<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2646917441"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1769332181"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="POP IN 2"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="伊駒ゆりえ / 潘めぐみ / 大久保瑠美 / B小町"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ「【推しの子】」キャラクターソングCD Vol.4"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:27.117"><div begin="00:05.050" end="04:19.547"><p begin="00:05.050" end="00:05.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">POP IN</p><p begin="00:06.400" end="00:07.106" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">POP IN 2</p><p begin="00:10.555" end="00:11.173" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">POP IN</p><p begin="00:11.891" end="00:12.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">POP IN 2</p><p begin="00:15.262" end="00:17.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">か・くして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像这样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku shi te</span></p><p begin="00:18.000" end="00:20.757" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">どこへどこへどこへも連れてって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论何处都带我一同前往吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko he do ko he do ko he mo tsu re te 't te</span></p><p begin="00:20.789" end="00:22.917" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">ひ・みつデート<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">秘密约会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi mi tsu de e to</span></p><p begin="00:23.488" end="00:26.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">キミはキミはキミは探せるかな？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你最后能不能找到线索呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ha ki mi ha ki mi ha sa ga se ru ka na ？</span></p><p begin="00:26.178" end="00:28.853" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">あらわるあたしは行く先々<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论我将会去往何处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ra wa ru a ta shi ha i ku sa ki za ki</span></p><p begin="00:28.880" end="00:31.491" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">あと先ざきなら考えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暂且都不考虑未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a to sa ki za ki na ra ka n ga e na i</span></p><p begin="00:31.501" end="00:34.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">パカラパカラ！ 馬もびっくり玉手箱<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打开珠宝箱连马儿也吓到乱蹿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pa ka ra pa ka ra u ma mo bi 'k ku ri ta ma te ba ko</span></p><p begin="00:34.267" end="00:36.871" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">手っ取り早くトリコになれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再犹豫被我所俘虏吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te 't to ri ba ya ku to ri ko ni na re</span></p><p begin="00:37.145" end="00:42.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">だってアクスタだけじゃ足りないでしょ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就只有立牌装饰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da 't te a ku su ta da ke ja</span></p><p begin="00:42.569" end="00:48.436" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">一瞬たりとも 離れない がぶっ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连一瞬间也都难舍难分 咔咘</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's shu n ta ri to mo ha na re na i ga bu '</span></p><p begin="00:49.383" end="00:50.393" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">アイらびゅポップゅー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀揣这份爱意突然出现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ra byu po 'p pyu u</span></p><p begin="00:50.403" end="00:52.048" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">よそ見しないでね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可不要三心二意哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo so mi shi na i de ne</span></p><p begin="00:52.104" end="00:53.728" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">愛あらわに結局は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">公开表达爱意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i a ra wa ni</span></p><p begin="00:53.738" end="00:54.835" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">おんりゅーじゃん！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到头来还是非你不可吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke 'k kyo ku ha o n ryu u ja n</span></p><p begin="00:54.870" end="00:56.408" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">行く先々現る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你的所到之处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku sa ki za ki</span></p><p begin="00:56.418" end="00:57.442" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">ポップゅらーびゅー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都会满怀爱意突然出现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ra wa ru po 'p pyu ra a byu u</span></p><p begin="00:57.487" end="01:00.217" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">ず～っと隣でね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要一直陪着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to to na ri de ne</span></p><p begin="01:00.227" end="01:01.453" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">ポッケからPOP IN<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从口袋之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po 'k ke ka ra pop in</span></p><p begin="01:01.495" end="01:02.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">忍ばせPOP IN 2<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄无声息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi no ba se pop in 2</span></p><p begin="01:02.946" end="01:04.182" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">踏んだり蹴ったりPOP IN<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">实在是祸不单行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu n da ri ke 't ta ri pop in</span></p><p begin="01:04.220" end="01:05.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">かくれんBOY<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">藏匿踪迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku re n boy</span></p><p begin="01:05.664" end="01:06.917" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">ポッケからPOP IN<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从口袋之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po 'k ke ka ra pop in</span></p><p begin="01:06.931" end="01:08.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">忍ばせPOP IN 2<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄无声息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi no ba se pop in 2</span></p><p begin="01:08.369" end="01:11.091" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">ぴょん！ 現るPOP INアイドル……<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">突然出现在眼前的偶像</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pyo n a ra wa ru pop in a i do ru</span></p><p begin="01:11.125" end="01:13.746" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">POP IN Happy 2 U!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">B小町：POP IN Happy 2 U（猛然现身将快乐献给你）！</span></p><p begin="01:14.606" end="01:15.238" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">POP IN</p><p begin="01:16.004" end="01:16.764" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">POP IN 2</p><p begin="01:20.029" end="01:20.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">POP IN</p><p begin="01:21.434" end="01:22.311" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">POP IN 2</p><p begin="01:30.357" end="01:32.465" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">ハ・グして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给我拥抱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha gu shi te</span></p><p begin="01:33.021" end="01:35.766" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">乙女乙女乙女の上目して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用满怀少女心的上挑视线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to me o to me o to me no u wa me shi te</span></p><p begin="01:35.776" end="01:37.833" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">ひ・みつシェイク<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">动摇秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi mi tsu she i ku</span></p><p begin="01:38.464" end="01:41.178" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">あまくあまくあまくかき混ぜるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这般甜甜蜜蜜地将它搅拌一番</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma ku a ma ku a ma ku ka ki ma ze ru no</span></p><p begin="01:41.188" end="01:43.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">群がるやつらは行く先々<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论为你聚集起来的家伙们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ra ga ru ya tsu ra ha yu ku sa ki za ki</span></p><p begin="01:43.821" end="01:46.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Latata歌えば列ができちゃう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将去往何处都会歌唱起来自觉排队</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Latata u ta e ba re tsu ga de ki cha u</span></p><p begin="01:46.469" end="01:49.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">パカラパカラ！ 馬車もひっくり変える予感<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有种预感</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pa ka ra pa ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:49.241" end="01:51.897" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">手っ取り早くキュートになれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点变得更加可爱一些吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te 't to ri ba ya ku kyu u to ni na re</span></p><p begin="01:52.170" end="01:54.939" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">キラキラ流る星に乗って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">乘着闪闪发光的流星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra ki ra na ga ru ho shi ni no 't te</span></p><p begin="01:54.949" end="01:57.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">時代をまわっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算时代历经流转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji da i wo ma wa 't te mo</span></p><p begin="01:57.536" end="02:02.958" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">1＋2に成る 式はLOVE? がぶっ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">1＋2的方程式也会是爱吧？咔咘</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi ＋ ni ni na ru shi ki ha love？ ga bu '</span></p><p begin="02:02.968" end="02:04.014" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">アイらびゅポップゅー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀揣这份爱意突然出现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ra byu po 'p pyu u</span></p><p begin="02:04.024" end="02:05.638" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">置いてかないでね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要把我丢在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o i te ka na i de ne</span></p><p begin="02:05.648" end="02:07.332" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">愛増し増し全力の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱意与日俱增 独一无二的你全力舞动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ma shi ma shi ze n ryo ku no o n ryu u dance</span></p><p begin="02:07.342" end="02:08.431" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">おんりゅーDance!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所到之处皆如影随形</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ku sa ki za ki ka ra ma ru</span></p><p begin="02:08.480" end="02:10.071" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">行く先々絡まる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所到之处皆与我们有所纠缠让你醉生梦死爱你哟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ku sa ki za ki ka ra ma ru</span></p><p begin="02:10.109" end="02:11.076" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">ポップゅらーびゅー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满怀爱意突然出现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po 'p pyu ra a byu u</span></p><p begin="02:11.125" end="02:13.912" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">ず～っと繋いでね？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要一直与我相伴？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to tsu na i de ne ？</span></p><p begin="02:13.922" end="02:15.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">ポッケからPOP IN<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从口袋之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po 'k ke ka ra pop in</span></p><p begin="02:15.078" end="02:16.553" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">狂わせPOP IN 2<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深陷疯狂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ru wa se pop in 2</span></p><p begin="02:16.563" end="02:17.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">行ったり来たりPOP IN<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来来回回循环往复</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 't ta ri ki ta ri pop in</span></p><p begin="02:17.857" end="02:19.294" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">フラストレーション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉有些欲求不满</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ra su to re e sho n</span></p><p begin="02:19.304" end="02:20.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">ポッケからPOP IN<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从口袋之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po 'k ke ka ra pop in</span></p><p begin="02:20.510" end="02:21.994" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">狂わせPOP IN 2<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此疯狂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ru wa se pop in 2</span></p><p begin="02:22.004" end="02:24.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">ひゅん！ 隠れるPOP INアイドル<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">突然在眼前消失的偶像</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hyu n ka ku re ru pop in a i do ru</span></p><p begin="02:36.646" end="02:37.268" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">POP IN</p><p begin="02:39.375" end="02:39.996" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">POP IN</p><p begin="02:40.531" end="02:41.242" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">POP IN 2</p><p begin="02:42.138" end="02:42.711" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">POP IN</p><p begin="02:44.807" end="02:45.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">POP IN</p><p begin="02:46.026" end="02:46.759" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">POP IN 2</p><p begin="02:48.002" end="02:50.676" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">どこそこ？ ロコモコ⁉︎ わかるかなぁ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪里那里？牛肉汉堡饭？你都明白吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko so ko ？ ro ko mo ko ？ wa ka ru ka na ？</span></p><p begin="02:50.686" end="02:53.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">客席まぎれてかなり不安っ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坐在观众席里心中满是不安</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kya ku se ki ma gi re te ka na ri fu a n '</span></p><p begin="02:53.464" end="02:56.077" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">どこどこどこどこ？ わかるかなぁ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪里哪里哪里哪里？ 你都明白吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko do ko do ko do ko ？ wa ka ru ka na ？</span></p><p begin="02:56.097" end="02:58.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">どこにいたってキミが1番<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论身在何处你都是第一</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ni i ta 't te ki mi ga i chi ba n</span></p><p begin="02:58.920" end="03:00.087" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">ねぇ あそんで？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 一起来玩吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne a so n de ？</span></p><p begin="03:00.097" end="03:01.948" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70">変わるがわる着せ替えごっこ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们一起玩换装游戏吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ru ga wa ru ki se ga e go 'k ko</span></p><p begin="03:01.958" end="03:04.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71">上？ 下？ 横？ あっぷっぷのぷー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">上面？下面？旁边？ 啊噗噗的噗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u e ？ shi ta ？ yo ko ？ a 'p pu 'p pu no pu u</span></p><p begin="03:04.309" end="03:07.038" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72">天国地獄大地獄 かわいいは作れると申しとく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天国地狱大地狱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te n go ku ji go ku o o chi go ku</span></p><p begin="03:07.048" end="03:09.792" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73">ねぇ いつでも呼んで？ ついてく360°<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 随时都要喊我哦？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne i tsu de mo yo n de ？</span></p><p begin="03:09.802" end="03:13.891" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L74">ドックドクン夢中Chu毒<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人心动不已如痴如醉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do 'k ku do ku n mu chu u chu do ku</span></p><p begin="03:15.309" end="03:19.303" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L75">ドックドクン夢中Chu毒<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人心动不已如痴如醉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do 'k ku do ku n mu chu u chu do ku</span></p><p begin="03:19.321" end="03:20.314" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76">アイらびゅポップゅー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀揣这份爱意突然出现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ra byu po 'p pyu u</span></p><p begin="03:20.324" end="03:22.037" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L77">置いてかないでね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要把我丢在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o i te ka na i de ne</span></p><p begin="03:22.047" end="03:24.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L78">愛増し増し全力のおんりゅーDance!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱意与日俱增 独一无二的你全力舞动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ma shi ma shi ze n ryo ku no o n ryu u dance</span></p><p begin="03:27.663" end="03:28.636" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L79">Dance!</p><p begin="03:30.264" end="03:31.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L80">アイらびゅポップゅー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀揣这份爱意突然出现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ra byu po 'p pyu u</span></p><p begin="03:31.264" end="03:33.066" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L81">よそ見しないでね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可不要三心二意哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo so mi shi na i de ne</span></p><p begin="03:33.066" end="03:35.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L82">愛あらわに結局はおんりゅーじゃん！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">公开表达爱意到最后还是非你不可吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i a ra wa ni ke 'k kyo ku ha o n ryu u ja n</span></p><p begin="03:35.664" end="03:38.374" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L83">行く先々現るポップゅらーびゅー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你的所到之处满怀爱意突然出现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ku sa ki za ki a ra wa ru po 'p pyu ra a byu u</span></p><p begin="03:38.419" end="03:41.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L84">ず～っと隣でね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要一直陪着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to to na ri de ne</span></p><p begin="03:41.168" end="03:42.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L85">ポッケからPOP IN<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:l